<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks rise at end-Aug from July.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks rise at end-Aug from July.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-August rubber stock figures,</p>
<p>issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month-</p>
<p>earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as</p>
<p>follows:</p>
<p>    Month	    Aug 96   Jul 96   Aug 95</p>
<p>    Stocks	   48,653   35,119   31,798</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   41,869   28,253   26,393</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 6,708    6,770    5,299</p>
<p>    Latex		  76	 96	106</p>
</text>
